exists su name hnuc gjat second via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya
exists su name prediction via state "vector float32" by num 2 be variable ya

ob ve float32 1 0 by ve float32 1 2 to name hwas at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob ve float32 1 0 by ve float32 2 1 to name hwas at num 1 be kl6m psas do

ob ve float32 1 0 by ve float32 2 1 to name htis hsek at num 0 be kl6m psas do
