ob ve float32 0 1 by ve float32 2 1 to name htis hsek second at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob ve float32 0 1 by ve float32 1 1.5 to name htis hsek second at num 1 be kl6m psas do

ob ve float32 1 0 by ve float32 1 5 to name hnuc gjat at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob ve float32 1 0 by ve float32 3 7 to name hnuc gjat at num 1 be kl6m psas do
ob ve float32 0 1 by ve float32 1 5 to name hnuc gjat second at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob ve float32 0 1 by ve float32 3 7 to name hnuc gjat second at num 1 be kl6m psas do

ob name hwas by name htis hsek to name prediction at num 0 be kl6m psas do
ob name hwas by name htis hsek second to name prediction at num 1 be kl6m psas do
from name prediction to name float count be gjat bwit do
from name prediction with name count to name vec float weight be subtract do
from name weight to name vec float vector be exponential do
from name vector to name float count be tfo2t do
from name vector with name count to name vec float prediction be dvis do
from name prediction at num 0 to name float weight first be choose do
from name prediction at num 1 to name float weight second be choose do
from name hnuc gjat with name weight first to name vec float hnuc gjat be multiply do
from name hnuc gjat second with name weight second to name vec float hnuc gjat second be multiply do
from name hnuc gjat with name hnuc gjat second to name vec float hnuc gjat be plus do
su name hnuc gjat ret
su name candidate prediction be ceremony prah

to name vec float hnuc gjat be candidate prediction do
